#: ../../source/docs/common-qiotek-zealot.rst:10
#: f4f8430abfff44289624e0fe63453cd9
msgid "The QioTek Zealot F427 is an internally vibration dampened autopilot with a protective CNC metal case for ruggedness. It features fully redundant sensors, expanded number of outputs, temperature controlled IMUs, and is the first high performance autopilot with integrated OSD chip."
msgstr ""

